    "adaptive_bounded_illustrative": {
      "description": "RESEARCH ONLY. Experimental two-state (bang-bang) issuance controller used to exercise the framework. NOT a proposed Mbongo adaptive monetary policy.",
      "controller_notes": [
        "Rule: below target_security_ratio use max_rate, otherwise use min_rate.",
        "Only the two band endpoints are ever used; no intermediate rate exists.",
        "target_security_ratio is a free illustrative parameter. It is NOT derived",
        "from any Mbongo threat or security model, because none exists yet.",
        "The ratio compares two reference-value quantities, so the MBO reference",
        "price appears in both numerator and denominator and cancels: the",
